              "value": "Extract the required learning-record fields from <previous_agent_response> and return only a JSON object that conforms to the node output schema.\n\nRules:\n- Return JSON only. No markdown, code fences, comments, explanations, SQL, Oracle q quoting, or repair snippets.\n- Do not output helper text such as q'[...] , replace(...), JSON.parse(...), or any prose before or after the JSON object.\n- Use only fields defined by the output schema.\n- Omit fields that are unavailable or ambiguous; do not invent values.\n- Keep string fields as plain text.\n- requestedStartDate and requestedCompleteByDate must be in YYYY-MM-DD format when present.\n- actualScore and actualEffortInHours must be numeric when present.\n\nField mapping:\n- Completion Date -> requestedCompleteByDate\n- Start Date -> requestedStartDate\n- Score -> actualScore\n- Effort -> actualEffortInHours\n- Title -> learningItemTitle\n- Description -> liShortDescription\n- Justification -> assignmentJustification\n\nINPUT:\n<previous_agent_response>{{$context.$variables.previousAgentResponse}}</previous_agent_response>"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"assignmentJustification\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"liTotalExpectedEffort\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"purchaseCurrency\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"purchaseAmount\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"liShortDescription\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"learningItemTitle\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"actualScore\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"actualEffortInHours\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"requestedStartDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        },\n        \"requestedCompleteByDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
