              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "If learning_transcript is populated then \n  - Update the learner that the transcript was recorded.\n  - Display key details from learning_transcript in concise, clean and readable format. \n  - Include a link under the summary with format `Click <a href=\"assignmentDetailsDeepLink\">here</a> to view the recorded transcript.` \n  - Thank the learner for given you an opportunity to tutor in a professional and humble tone and invite them to learner additional topics by suggesting related topics based on learningItemTitle and learningItemDescription.\n\nIf learning_transcript is empty then \n   - Inform learner the transcript/external learning was not recorded. \n   - Suggest to manually record external learning : {{$context.$variables.recordExternalLearningDeepLink}}.\n\nUse some freedom to format the content. Do not modify or add anything new to the given input, just present it in a clear, professional, and learner-friendly format.\n\nINPUT:\n<learning_transcript>{{$context.$nodes.TRIM_LEARNING_RECORD_DETAILS.$output.result}}</learning_transcript>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "End of data pipeline",
            "name": "End"
          },
